[For "white"]
[Kind "sideline"]
[Start "ruy-berlin 6.Nxe5"]
[Name "6...Be7: blocking the file first"]

6... Be7 { Blocks the e-file, so now the bishop on b5 really is hit. }
7. Bf1 { Pulls the bishop back and keeps all the pieces on. Taking on c6 is the most common move here, and players score only 41% with it, because Black's pieces come out quickly. }
7... Nxe5
8. Rxe5 { The same position as in the main Berlin line. } *
